{"v":4,"desc":"內容包含：\n- Little Nightmares™\n- Little Nightmares™ Secrets of The Maw\n\n置身於黑暗風格的異想故事──Little Nightmares的世界中，面對屬於你的兒時夢魘！貪顎號──是艘巨大又神祕的船隻，盤踞其中的腐敗靈魂正打算飽餐一頓，快幫助小六與男孩從中脫逃吧。\n\n在貪顎號裡，有另外一個人受困其中──逃命男孩，幫助男孩逃離不祥之地，展開不同於小六的冒險，揭開貪顎號所有的神祕面紗。","publisher":"BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Asia","release":"2020-03-12","genres":["冒險","益智","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 3.2GB / Switch 3.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2214107ce0b5481154c9db110be50eacfaa9f8374c8f76a9e7c13520c306b8b5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2dde8b73734b6874cc4436f72bced357a855c9a3f33e34ddb5253b15a5d1edb4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f09e65079d0a10fc8998938d4ffb5783ed2f44132e73f92131b941c4b4c5f43.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1c3dcf82a9105180b05e001da04cc7526f46de1a939780e35555ff268e19019.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b08d3716f4a8908ea0fc96aa72c50d505290e6efdadc3c28a08d6671659f9c78.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c89015da723b462eb4f4fc0b14899e318f29f48f47f15bd24c841187052273f.jpg"],"titleId":"01002fc00412c000","dlc":[]}